# REQ-003: Full-Page Chat Mode
**Priority:** Must Have
**Effort:** Low
**Risk:** Low
**Depends On:** REQ-001
---
## User Story
As an authenticated EMIS-X partner developer,
I need a full-page chat view for the Q&A bot,
So that I have more screen real estate for complex conversations without leaving the portal.
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] A dedicated full-page chat view is available at a fixed portal route (e.g. `/chat`)
- [ ] Full-page view provides the same Q&A functionality as the widget — same bot, same citations, same escalation flow
- [ ] Conversation history is shared between widget and full-page view within the same browser session
- [ ] Widget includes an "expand" button to open the full-page view
- [ ] Full-page view includes a "back" / "minimise" control to return to the widget
- [ ] Both widget and full-page view require EMIS-X authentication — unauthenticated users cannot access the bot
