## Dimension 4: Observability & Performance
### Product KPIs
- **KPI 1:** Full-page view usage rate vs widget usage rate
- **KPI 2:** Session continuity success rate (conversation persists between views)
- **KPI 3:** Auth failure rate on full-page route
### Observable Events (OTEL Instrumentation)
- **Span 1:** `qabot.fullpage.open.start`
  - **Attributes:** user_id, source (widget_expand / direct_url), session_id
- **Span 2:** `qabot.fullpage.open.complete`
  - **Attributes:** user_id, session_id, duration_ms, status
- **Span 3:** `qabot.fullpage.minimise`
  - **Attributes:** user_id, session_id, duration_ms
### Performance SLOs
- **Latency p95:** < 300ms for widget ↔ full-page transition (no reload)
- **Availability:** 99.9%
- **Error Rate:** < 0.1%
### Alerting Conditions
- **Critical:** Full-page route returning 5xx errors → PagerDuty
- **Warning:** Auth failure rate > 5% → Slack
